<node TEXT="securityContext - повысить привилегии" ID="ID_460016069" CREATED="1756111905743" MODIFIED="1756112204977"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      определение DaemonSet, запрашивающего привилегии для своих подов
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># admin-ds.yaml </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">apiVersion: apps/v1 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">kind: DaemonSet </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">metadata: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;name: admin-workload </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">spec: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;selector: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;matchLabels: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;name: admin-app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;template: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;metadata: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;labels: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;name: admin-app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;spec: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;containers: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- name: admin-container </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;image: ubuntu </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console; font-weight: bold;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;command: [&quot;sleep&quot;, &quot;infinity&quot;] </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console; font-weight: bold;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;securityContext: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console; font-weight: bold;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;privileged: true</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      Под с такими привилегиями фактически получает права суперпользователя root и может, например, смонтировать в контейнер файловую систему узла
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #0000c0;">kubectl exec -it admin-workload-px6xg -- bash </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #0000c0;">mount /dev/sda1 /tmp/host</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
<node TEXT="securityContext - понизить привилегии" ID="ID_33739453" CREATED="1756112210629" MODIFIED="1756112270125"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">apiVersion: v1 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">kind: Pod </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">metadata: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;name: ubuntu </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;labels: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;pod: ubuntu-pod </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">spec: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;containers: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- name: ubuntu-container </span>
