      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;print(&quot;Hello world!&quot;) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">hi() </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">```</span>
    </p>
