<node TEXT="4. Деплой" FOLDED="true" POSITION="bottom_or_right" ID="ID_617523245" CREATED="1771328582319" MODIFIED="1772013154424"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <a href="#ID_1806519711">Fastlane</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Типы реестров</span>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Container Registry - Docker-образы. FREE
      </li>
      <li>
        Package Registry - NPM, Maven, PyPI, NuGet, Conan, Helm, Generic. FREE
      </li>
      <li>
        Model Registry - ML-модели и метаданные
      </li>
      <li>
        Terraform Registry - Модули и state-файлы Terraform. FREE
      </li>
      <li>
        Virtual Registry - Агрегация нескольких реестров. Premium/Ultimate
      </li>
      <li>
        Dependency Proxy - Кэш внешних зависимостей. Premium/Ultimate
      </li>
    </ul>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
<node TEXT="Package Registry" FOLDED="true" ID="ID_356569164" CREATED="1771486304661" MODIFIED="1771489342421"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Package Registry </span>- встроенная функция GitLab, которая позволяет хранить, управлять и распространять пакеты программного обеспечения в рамках вашей экосистемы GitLab
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      Поддерживаемые форматы (версии &gt;= 18)
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Универсальные пакеты (Generic): Для произвольных файлов
      </li>
      <li>
        Языково-специфичные: npm, PyPI, NuGet, Maven, Go, Composer
      </li>
      <li>
        Системы управления пакетами: Conan (1 и 2)
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">1. Аутентификация в реестре</span>
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>
        Создать токен: Settings &gt; Repository &gt; Deploy &gt; Tokens
      </li>
      <li>
        <span style="color: #0000c0;">curl --user &quot;hfc-generic-build:&lt;пароль токена развертывания&gt;&quot; ${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/stable-releases/0.0.1/my_app.tar.gz</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">curl</span>&#xa0;- утилита для передачи данных по сетевым протоколам (здесь: HTTP-запрос к GitLab API)
      </li>
      <li>
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">--user &quot;hfc-generic-build:&lt;пароль токена развертывания&gt;&quot;</span>&#xa0;- аутентификация через Deploy Token
      </li>
      <li>
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">${CI_API_V4_URL}</span>&#xa0;- переменная GitLab CI, содержит URL API (напр., https://gitlab.com/api/v4)
      </li>
      <li>
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">${CI_PROJECT_ID}</span>&#xa0;- переменная GitLab CI, ID проекта (автоподстановка в пайплайне)
      </li>
      <li>
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">/packages/generic/...</span>&#xa0;- путь к Generic Package Registry (хранилище кастомных артефактов)
      </li>
      <li>
        Назначение: загрузка артефакта my_app.tar.gz версии 0.0.1 для развертывания
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">2. Создание и загрузка пакетов с помощью CI/CD заданий </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">stages: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">build_app: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- make my_app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- TIMESTAMP=$(date +%s) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- tar -czvf my_app_$TIMESTAMP.tar.gz . </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ./*.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">publish_to_registry: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- $PACKAGE_FILE=$(ls | grep *.tar.gz) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl --user &quot;hfc-generic-build:&lt;deploy token password&gt;&quot; --upload-file my_app.tar.gz &quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/stable_releases/0.0.1/$PACKAGE_FILE&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;dependencies: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- build_app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">3. Использование пакетов из Package Registry (Скачать пакет) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">download_and_run: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl --header &quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--output my_app.tar.gz \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/my-package/1.0.0/my_app.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- tar -xzf my_app.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ./my_app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      или
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">use_package_from_registry: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: run_package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- wget --header=&quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/stable_releases/0.0.1/my_app_.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- tar -xvf my_app_.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ./my_app</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
<node TEXT="Полный пример CI/CD pipeline" ID="ID_583454348" CREATED="1771490384132" MODIFIED="1771490415607"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># GitLab CI/CD Pipeline для Package Registry </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">stages: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- lint </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- test </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- cleanup </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># Переменные </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">variables: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;PACKAGE_NAME: &quot;my-app&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;PACKAGE_VERSION: &quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;GENERIC_PACKAGE_PATH: &quot;generic/${PACKAGE_NAME}/${PACKAGE_VERSION}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 1. Lint Code </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">lint: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: lint </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: node:20-alpine </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm ci </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm run lint </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == &quot;merge_request_event&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 2. Unit Tests </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">test: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: test </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: node:20-alpine </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm ci </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm run test:unit </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;reports: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;junit: test-results.xml </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- coverage/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;expire_in: 1 week </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 3. Build Application </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">build: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: node:20-alpine </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm ci </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm run build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- dist/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- package.json </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;expire_in: 1 hour </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 4. Create Package Archive </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">create-package: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: alpine:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;dependencies: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- apk add --no-cache tar gzip </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- mkdir -p package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- cp -r dist/* package/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- cp package.json package/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- cp README.md package/ 2&gt;/dev/null || true </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- tar -czf ${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}.tar.gz package/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ls -lh *.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;expire_in: 1 hour </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 5. Publish to Generic Package Registry </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">publish-generic: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: curlimages/curl:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;dependencies: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- create-package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Publishing generic package...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Публикация с тегом коммита </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl --request PUT </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--header &quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--upload-file &quot;${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/${PACKAGE_NAME}/${CI_COMMIT_SHA}/${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Публикация latest для main ветки </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if [ &quot;$CI_COMMIT_BRANCH&quot; == &quot;main&quot; ]; then </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl --request PUT </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--header &quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--upload-file &quot;${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/${PACKAGE_NAME}/latest/${PACKAGE_NAME}-latest.tar.gz&quot;; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;fi </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Публикация с версией для тегов </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if [ -n &quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; ]; then </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl --request PUT </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--header &quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--upload-file &quot;${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/${PACKAGE_NAME}/${CI_COMMIT_TAG}/${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_TAG}.tar.gz&quot;; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;fi </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Package published successfully&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- create-package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 6. Publish NPM Package (если применимо) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">publish-npm: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: node:20-alpine </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Publishing NPM package to GitLab Registry...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Настройка .npmrc для GitLab Registry </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;@${CI_PROJECT_PATH_NAMESPACE}:registry=${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/npm/&quot; &gt; .npmrc </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;//${CI_SERVER_HOST}/api/v4/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/npm/:_authToken=${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; &gt;&gt; .npmrc </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Обновление версии в package.json </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if [ -n &quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; ]; then </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;npm version &quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; --no-git-tag-version; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;else </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;npm version &quot;$(cat package.json | jq -r .version)-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}&quot; --no-git-tag-version; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;fi </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Публикация </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm publish --access internal </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ NPM package published&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 7. Download &amp; Use Package (в другом проекте) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">use-package: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: alpine:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- apk add --no-cache curl tar gzip </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Downloading package from registry...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Скачивание последней версии </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl --header &quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--output package.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/${PACKAGE_NAME}/latest/${PACKAGE_NAME}-latest.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Распаковка </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- tar -xzf package.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ls -la package/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Установка/запуск (пример) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- cp -r package/* /app/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Package deployed&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- publish-generic </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 8. Deploy to Environment </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">deploy-staging: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: alpine:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- apk add --no-cache curl jq </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Deploying to staging...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- PACKAGE_URL=&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/${PACKAGE_NAME}/${CI_COMMIT_SHA}/${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_SHA}.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Вызов API деплоя </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl -X POST &quot;$STAGING_DEPLOY_URL&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Authorization: Bearer $DEPLOY_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-d &quot;{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;package_url\&quot;: \&quot;$PACKAGE_URL\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;token\&quot;: \&quot;${CI_JOB_TOKEN}\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;environment\&quot;: \&quot;staging\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;commit\&quot;: \&quot;$CI_COMMIT_SHA\&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Staging deployment complete&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;environment: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;name: staging </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;url: https://staging.example.com </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- publish-generic </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">deploy-production: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: alpine:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- apk add --no-cache curl jq </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Deploying to production...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- PACKAGE_URL=&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/${PACKAGE_NAME}/${CI_COMMIT_TAG}/${PACKAGE_NAME}-${CI_COMMIT_TAG}.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Деплой на production </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl -X POST &quot;$PROD_DEPLOY_URL&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Authorization: Bearer $PROD_DEPLOY_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-d &quot;{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;package_url\&quot;: \&quot;$PACKAGE_URL\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;token\&quot;: \&quot;${CI_JOB_TOKEN}\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;environment\&quot;: \&quot;production\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;version\&quot;: \&quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG\&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Smoke tests </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- sleep 30 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl -f https://api.example.com/health </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Создание релиза </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl --request POST --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/releases&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;tag_name=$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;name=Release $CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;description=Automated release&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Production deployment complete&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;environment: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;name: production </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;url: https://example.com </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;when: manual </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- publish-generic </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 9. Cleanup Old Packages (scheduled) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">cleanup-packages: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: cleanup </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: curlimages/curl:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Cleaning up old packages...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Получить список пакетов </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;PACKAGES=$(curl --silent --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/packages?package_type=generic&quot; | \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;jq -r '.[].id') </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Удалить старые пакеты (кроме protected) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;for pkg in $PACKAGES; do </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;VERSION=$(curl --silent --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/packages/$pkg&quot; | jq -r '.version') </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Не удалять latest и версии с тегами </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;if [[ &quot;$VERSION&quot; != &quot;latest&quot; &amp;&amp; ! &quot;$VERSION&quot; =~ ^v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+$ ]]; then </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;echo &quot;Deleting package: $pkg (version: $VERSION)&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl --request DELETE --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/packages/$pkg&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;fi </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;done </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Cleanup complete&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == &quot;schedule&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;when: manual </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 10. Notify (опционально) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">notify-slack: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: curlimages/curl:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl -X POST &quot;$SLACK_WEBHOOK&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H 'Content-type: application/json' \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--data &quot;{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;text\&quot;: \&quot;Package Published: ${PACKAGE_NAME}\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;attachments\&quot;: [{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;color\&quot;: \&quot;good\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;fields\&quot;: [ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;{\&quot;title\&quot;: \&quot;Version\&quot;, \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;${PACKAGE_VERSION:-$CI_COMMIT_SHA}\&quot;, \&quot;short\&quot;: true}, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;{\&quot;title\&quot;: \&quot;Environment\&quot;, \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;$CI_ENVIRONMENT_NAME\&quot;, \&quot;short\&quot;: true} </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;] </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}] </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;when: on_success</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
<node TEXT="пример pipeline" ID="ID_618614713" CREATED="1771489970866" MODIFIED="1771490421122"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">stages: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">build-app: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Building application...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- tar -czf my_app.tar.gz ./app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- my_app.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">upload-to-registry: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: package </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl --header &quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--upload-file my_app.tar.gz \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/my-app/${CI_COMMIT_TAG}/my_app.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG&#xa0;&#xa0;# Только для тегов </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">deploy-from-registry: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl --header &quot;JOB-TOKEN: ${CI_JOB_TOKEN}&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--output app.tar.gz \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;${CI_API_V4_URL}/projects/${CI_PROJECT_ID}/packages/generic/my-app/${CI_COMMIT_TAG}/my_app.tar.gz&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- tar -xzf app.tar.gz </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ./deploy.sh </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
</node>
<node TEXT="Container Registry" FOLDED="true" ID="ID_1774658754" CREATED="1771486467215" MODIFIED="1771488679932"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <a href="#ID_1678108496">Dockerfile</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Container Registry</span>&#xa0;- Встроенный реестр Docker-образов, совместимый с Docker Registry API v2. Позволяет хранить, версионировать и распространять образы в рамках проекта или группы
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Включите Dependency Scanning для образов
      </li>
      <li>
        Используйте иммутабельные теги (--immutable) для защиты от перезаписи
      </li>
      <li>
        В нашем репозитории требуется файл под названием Dockerfile
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Авторизация</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      # Через CI_JOB_TOKEN (в пайплайне)
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #0000c0;">docker login registry.gitlab.com -u gitlab-ci-token -p $CI_JOB_TOKEN</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      # Через Personal/Deploy Token (локально)
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #0000c0;">docker login registry.gitlab.com -u &lt;username&gt; -p &lt;token&gt;</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Push / Pull</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #0000c0;">docker tag my-app:latest registry.gitlab.com/namespace/project/my-app:latest</span>&#xa0;&#xa0;# Тегирование
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #0000c0;">docker push registry.gitlab.com/namespace/project/my-app:latest</span>&#xa0;&#xa0;# Отправка
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #0000c0;">docker pull registry.gitlab.com/namespace/project/my-app:latest</span>&#xa0;&#xa0;# Получение
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Интеграция с CI/CD (пример .gitlab-ci.yml)</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">build-image: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: docker:stable</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;services: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker:dind</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;variables: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;IMAGE: $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_SHORT_SHA </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker login -u $CI_REGISTRY_USER -p $CI_REGISTRY_PASSWORD $CI_REGISTRY </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker build -t $IMAGE . </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker push $IMAGE </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Использование образа как base image для job</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">use_container_from_registry: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: run </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: registry.gitlab.com/ivan/hats-for-cats/my_app:0.0.1 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- ls -al </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- my_app --version</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
<node TEXT="Администрирование" ID="ID_157656463" CREATED="1771487072684" MODIFIED="1771488448603"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Администрирование (Self-managed)</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Конфигурация (gitlab.rb):</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">registry_enable = true </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">registry_external_url 'https://registry.gitlab.example.com' </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">registry_nginx['enable'] = true </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># Хранилище (рекомендуется S3 для prod) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">registry['storage'] = { </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;'s3' =&gt; { </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;'accesskey' =&gt; '...', </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;'secretkey' =&gt; '...', </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;'bucket' =&gt; 'gitlab-registry' </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;} </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">}</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Мониторинг</span>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Метрики: /metrics на порту реестра
      </li>
      <li>
        Логи: /var/log/gitlab/registry/
      </li>
      <li>
        Health check: GET /health
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Резервное копирование</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      Реестр включается в gitlab-backup create при настройке registry в gitlab.rb
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Очистка (Cleanup Policies)</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      Настройка: Project Settings &gt; Packages and registries &gt; Container registry
    </p>
    <p>
      Запуск вручную: API POST /projects/:id/registry/repositories/:repo_id/tags с параметром keep_n
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
<node TEXT="Полный пример CI/CD pipeline" ID="ID_255059005" CREATED="1771490162518" MODIFIED="1771490379793"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># GitLab CI/CD Pipeline для Container Registry </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">stages: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- lint </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- test </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- security </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;- deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># Переменные (можно переопределить в UI) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">variables: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;DOCKER_HOST: tcp://docker:2375 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;DOCKER_TLS_CERTDIR: &quot;/certs&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;DOCKER_DRIVER: overlay2 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;# Имя образа </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;IMAGE_NAME: &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;# Теги </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;COMMIT_SHA: &quot;$CI_COMMIT_SHORT_SHA&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;BRANCH_SLUG: &quot;$CI_COMMIT_REF_SLUG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 1. Lint Dockerfile </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">docker-lint: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: lint </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: hadolint/hadolint:latest-alpine </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- hadolint Dockerfile </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == &quot;merge_request_event&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 2. Unit Tests </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">unit-tests: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: test </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: node:20-alpine&#xa0;&#xa0;# Замените на свой runtime </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm install </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm run test:unit </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- npm run build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- dist/ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;expire_in: 1 hour </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == &quot;merge_request_event&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 3. Build Docker Image </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">build-image: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: docker:24.0 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;services: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker:24.0-dind </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;variables: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;IMAGE_TAG: &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$COMMIT_SHA&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;IMAGE_LATEST: &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:latest&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker login -u &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_USER&quot; -p &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_PASSWORD&quot; &quot;$CI_REGISTRY&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Сборка с тегами </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker build </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--tag &quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--tag &quot;$IMAGE_LATEST&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--build-arg BUILD_DATE=&quot;$(date -u +'%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ')&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--build-arg VCS_REF=&quot;$CI_COMMIT_SHA&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--build-arg VERSION=&quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;. </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Показать информацию </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker images &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Сохраняем образ для следующих stages </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker save &quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; &gt; image.tar </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- image.tar </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;expire_in: 1 hour </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 4. Security Scanning </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">trivy-scan: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: security </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: aquasec/trivy:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;services: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker:24.0-dind </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;variables: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;IMAGE_TAG: &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$COMMIT_SHA&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker login -u &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_USER&quot; -p &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_PASSWORD&quot; &quot;$CI_REGISTRY&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker load &lt; image.tar </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Сканирование на уязвимости </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- trivy image </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--severity CRITICAL,HIGH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--format table </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--exit-code 1 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Генерация отчета в SARIF </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- trivy image </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--severity CRITICAL,HIGH,MEDIUM,LOW </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--format sarif </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--output trivy-results.sarif </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;artifacts: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;reports: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;container_scanning: trivy-results.sarif </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;paths: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- trivy-results.sarif </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;when: always </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;allow_failure: true </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 5. Integration Tests </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">integration-tests: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: test </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: docker:24.0 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;services: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker:24.0-dind </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;variables: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;IMAGE_TAG: &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$COMMIT_SHA&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker login -u &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_USER&quot; -p &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_PASSWORD&quot; &quot;$CI_REGISTRY&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker load &lt; image.tar </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Запуск контейнера для тестов </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker run -d --name test-app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-e NODE_ENV=test </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-p 3000:3000 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Ждем запуска </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- sleep 10 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Health check </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl -f http://localhost:3000/health || exit 1 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Запуск интеграционных тестов </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker exec test-app npm run test:integration </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Очистка </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker stop test-app &amp;&amp; docker rm test-app </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 6. Push to Registry </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">push-to-registry: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: docker:24.0 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;services: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker:24.0-dind </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;variables: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;IMAGE_TAG: &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$COMMIT_SHA&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker login -u &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_USER&quot; -p &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_PASSWORD&quot; &quot;$CI_REGISTRY&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker load &lt; image.tar </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Push с тегом коммита </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Pushing image: $IMAGE_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker push &quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Push latest для main ветки </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if [ &quot;$CI_COMMIT_BRANCH&quot; == &quot;main&quot; ]; then </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;docker tag &quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:latest&quot; &amp;&amp; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;docker push &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:latest&quot;; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;fi </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Push с тегом версии (для tags) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if [ -n &quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; ]; then </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;docker tag &quot;$IMAGE_TAG&quot; &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; &amp;&amp; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;docker push &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot;; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;fi </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Показать digest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- docker images --digests &quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- build-image </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- integration-tests </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 7. Deploy to Staging </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">deploy-staging: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: alpine:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- apk add --no-cache curl jq </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Deploying to staging...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- IMAGE_TAG=&quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$COMMIT_SHA&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Пример вызова API для деплоя (замените на свой) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl -X POST &quot;https://staging.example.com/api/deploy&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Authorization: Bearer $DEPLOY_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-d &quot;{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;image\&quot;: \&quot;$IMAGE_TAG\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;environment\&quot;: \&quot;staging\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;commit\&quot;: \&quot;$CI_COMMIT_SHA\&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Health check staging </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- sleep 30 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl -f https://staging.example.com/health </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Staging deployment complete&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;environment: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;name: staging </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;url: https://staging.example.com </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- push-to-registry </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 8. Deploy to Production (manual) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">deploy-production: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: alpine:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;before_script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- apk add --no-cache curl jq </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Deploying to production...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- IMAGE_TAG=&quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Деплой на production </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl -X POST &quot;https://prod.example.com/api/deploy&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Authorization: Bearer $PROD_DEPLOY_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-d &quot;{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;image\&quot;: \&quot;$IMAGE_TAG\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;environment\&quot;: \&quot;production\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;version\&quot;: \&quot;$CI_COMMIT_TAG\&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Smoke tests </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- sleep 60 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- curl -f https://api.example.com/health </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Создание релиза в GitLab </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl --request POST --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/releases&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;tag_name=$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;name=Release $CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;description=Automated release for $CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;assets[links][][name]=Docker Image&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--form &quot;assets[links][][url]=$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_TAG&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Production deployment complete&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;environment: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;name: production </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;url: https://example.com </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;when: manual </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;needs: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- push-to-registry </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># 9. Cleanup Old Images (scheduled) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">cleanup-registry: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: publish </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: curlimages/curl:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;Cleaning up old images...&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Получить список репозиториев </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;REPOS=$(curl --silent --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/registry/repositories&quot; | \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;jq -r '.[].id') </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;# Удалить старые теги (кроме latest и защищенных) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;for repo in $REPOS; do </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;TAGS=$(curl --silent --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/registry/repositories/$repo/tags&quot; | \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;jq -r '.[].name' | grep -v -E 'latest|main|v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+') </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;for tag in $TAGS; do </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;echo &quot;Deleting tag: $tag&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl --request DELETE --header &quot;PRIVATE-TOKEN: $GITLAB_TOKEN&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&quot;$CI_API_V4_URL/projects/$CI_PROJECT_ID/registry/repositories/$repo/tags/$tag&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;done </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;done </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- echo &quot;✅ Cleanup complete&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == &quot;schedule&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;when: manual </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># Уведомления (опционально) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># ============================================ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">notify-slack: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;stage: deploy </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;image: curlimages/curl:latest </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;script: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;curl -X POST &quot;$SLACK_WEBHOOK&quot; \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;-H 'Content-type: application/json' \ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;--data &quot;{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;text\&quot;: \&quot;Deployment ${CI_COMMIT_TAG}\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;attachments\&quot;: [{ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;color\&quot;: \&quot;good\&quot;, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;\&quot;fields\&quot;: [ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;{\&quot;title\&quot;: \&quot;Environment\&quot;, \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;$CI_ENVIRONMENT_NAME\&quot;, \&quot;short\&quot;: true}, </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;{\&quot;title\&quot;: \&quot;Image\&quot;, \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;$CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE:$CI_COMMIT_TAG\&quot;, \&quot;short\&quot;: true} </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;] </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}] </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;}&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;rules: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == &quot;main&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;when: on_success</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
</node>
