<node TEXT="README.md" ID="ID_116056327" CREATED="1761133245794" MODIFIED="1761134520219"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">--- </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># nginx </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">Устанавливает и настраивает веб-сервер Nginx на хостах под управлением **Ubuntu 20.04/22.04** или **Debian 11/12**. </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">## Требования </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">- ОС: Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+ </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">- Ansible ≥ 2.10 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">- Доступ с правами `sudo` </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">## Установка </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">```bash </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">ansible-galaxy install yourname.nginx </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">``` </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">Или через `requirements.yml`: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">```yaml </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">- src: yourname.nginx </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;version: 1.0.0 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">``` </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">## Использование </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">### Минимальный плейбук </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">```yaml </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">- hosts: webservers </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;roles: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- yourname.nginx </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">``` </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">### С настройкой порта </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">```yaml </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">- hosts: webservers </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;roles: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;- role: yourname.nginx </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;vars: </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;nginx_port: 8080 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">``` </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">## Переменные </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">| Имя | По умолчанию | Описание | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">|-----|--------------|--------| </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">| `nginx_port` | `80` | Порт основного сервера | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">| `nginx_remove_default_site` | `true` | Удалять ли `/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/default` | </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">Полный список — в [`defaults/main.yml`](defaults/main.yml). </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">## Обработчики </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">- `restart nginx` — перезапускает службу при изменении конфигурации. </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">## Лицензия </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">MIT </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">## Автор </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">yourname — your.email@example.com&#xa0; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">Репозиторий: https://github.com/yourname/ansible-role-nginx</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
<node TEXT="defaults/main.yml" ID="ID_99907384" CREATED="1761133249138" MODIFIED="1761134205228"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">--- </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;"># Переменные по умолчанию (низкий приоритет) </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">nginx_port: 80 </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">nginx_worker_processes: &quot;auto&quot; </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">nginx_remove_default_site: true</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
<node TEXT="files/nginx-welcome.txt" ID="ID_1524363881" CREATED="1761133389164" MODIFIED="1761134196363"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">Welcome to our custom Nginx server! </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span style="color: #008000; font-family: Lucida Console;">Managed by Ansible.</span>
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
</node>
